# The proven-rule allow-list

`Opt.provenSimplifyRules` and `Opt.RuleAllow` (which exported rules may contribute candidates).
Kept apart from `FV/Opt/Rules.lean`: the rule proof modules (`FV/Opt/Proof/Rule*.lean`) import
`Rules.lean` but not this file, so extending the allow-list rebuilds only `Optimize`,
`Proof/RuleAll.lean` and their dependents.
-/

